{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110480","id":3412677405,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7LaVMd","number":110480,"title":"_ready called twice on custom bottom_panel controls","user":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-09-13T05:43:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T12:29:18Z","closed_at":"2025-09-13T12:02:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.rc2, 4.4.1.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, Godot Engine v4.5.rc2.officia, Forward+ - dedicated geforce 4080 gtx\n\n### Issue description\n\nControls added with [EditorPlugin.add_control_to_bottom_panel](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/4.4/classes/class_editorplugin.html#class-editorplugin-method-add-control-to-bottom-panel) in an addons `enter_tree` function have their `_ready` function called twice.\n\nThis is a problem since bottom panels often connect signals in their _ready and if signals are connected multiple times it can result in undesired behaviour.\n\nNote that `@onready` calls are also affected.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create an addon with the following:\n```gdscript\n# myplugin.gd\n@tool\nextends EditorPlugin\n\nvar mypanel: MyPanel\n\nfunc _enter_tree() -> void:\n\tprint(\"entering tree\")\n\tmypanel = load(\"res://addons/bottompaneltest/my_panel.tscn\").instantiate()\n\tadd_control_to_bottom_panel(mypanel, \"My Panel\")\n\n\nfunc _exit_tree() -> void:\n\tremove_control_from_bottom_panel(mypanel)\n\n# my_panel.gd\n@tool\nextends Control\nclass_name MyPanel\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tprint(\"_ready called\")\n\n```\n- Restart the editor\n\nYou'll see the following output:\n> entering tree\n_ready called\n_ready called\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nMRP: [bottom-panel-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22308951/bottom-panel-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Flynsarmy","id":334808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNDgwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/334808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy","html_url":"https://github.com/Flynsarmy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flynsarmy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110480/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}